Subject: [PATCH] configure: avoid embedding build paths in build information

The generated build-information dialog only needs to identify the build
flags. Embedding the complete CXXFLAGS also embeds the temporary Yocto work
directory and makes the installed binary fail the buildpaths QA check.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [OE-specific reproducibility fix]
---
 configure.ac | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/configure.ac b/configure.ac
--- a/configure.ac
+++ b/configure.ac
@@ -24 +24 @@
-#define USED_CXXFLAGS "$CXXFLAGS"
+#define USED_CXXFLAGS "Yocto target build flags"
